Author: AMUN contributors

Version:
  Major: 0
  Minor: 1
  Revision: 0

# A zero/empty target list lets Luma select this as default.3gx. AMUN performs a
# second, full 64-bit Title-ID gate against /amun/packs/<TID>/game.amunpack.
Targets:
  - 0

Title: AMUN
Summary: Read-only local achievement observer
Description: |
  AMUN monitors explicitly supported native 3DS games for achievement events.
  This conservative build contains no game-memory write API and no networking.

Compatibility: Console
MemorySize: 5MiB
EventsSelfManaged: false
SwapNotNeeded: false
UsePrivateMemory: false
AllowHomebrewLoad: false
